# Local sidecar settings. Copy to engine/.env, or save from the web Settings panel.
# The panel rewrites engine/.env (gitignored). This example stays blank.
# 本地引擎配置。复制为 engine/.env，或在网页「设置」里保存。
# 设置面板会重写 engine/.env（已被 git 忽略）。示例文件保持空白。
# Do not commit filled-in secrets. 不要提交密钥。

# OPENAI_BASE_URL=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# COMFYUI_BASE_URL=
# COMFYUI_API_KEY=
# WAN_API_BASE=
# WAN_API_KEY=
# KLING_API_BASE=
# KLING_ACCESS_KEY=
# KLING_SECRET_KEY=
# KLING_API_KEY=

# Edge 语音不需要密钥。引擎直接请求微软的语音 HTTP 接口，不使用 edge-tts。
# CosyVoice 是你本机另开的 HTTP 服务。留空时引擎使用 http://127.0.0.1:50000。
# Edge speech needs no key. CosyVoice is a server you run. Blank uses http://127.0.0.1:50000.
# COSYVOICE_BASE_URL=
# COSYVOICE_API_KEY=
